# round 232 (w232): the genotype-only amino-acid control (w141, 0.048 over twelve seeds) with a betaxanthin head trained jointly (--aux-betaxanthin, the reverse co-head, weight 1). INDUCTIVE: betaxanthin is a training target, never an input, and every pinned gene's betaxanthin record sits in the test block; this is the inductive form of w225 (the betaxanthin score as an INPUT, 0.078), which needs the held-out strain's own measurement. Selection and scoring stay on the amino acids. Paired against w141 by seed. Six seeds at 36 GB.
